From 63b19124136f348b65979ffde3d34dfc70f82c51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kozz36 <vjose8506@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:07:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(coding-agent): resolve live tool owners with dispatch
 precedence

Bind registered forwarding to the live merged tool registry, including
custom tools and extension shadowing. Preserve exact definition and
delegate validity during pending approval and session replacement.
Keep public dynamic-tool regressions and extension docs with the change.

Retained evidence: scoped SDK verification and the public session probe;
post-correction focused self, independent and parent spot checks each
passed 42 tests including the unchanged dynamic-tool cases. No execution
of every intermediate repository snapshot or global PASS is claimed.
The native gate and its prototype-policy correction were approved and
acknowledged separately; that approval is not this unit's authority.
GP global remains RED; consultation causality remains UNKNOWN.
No activation, publication, global install, or P01 operation.

Risk: items 2 and 4 (live executor ownership and pending invocation state).
